WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,380
Clay plus wooden jar plus cord

2
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,780
Craftable clay kiln

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,780
This thing is more practical than gold on the island

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:15,800
first synthesis

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,400
The lungs can be lifted

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,200
Fifteen kilometers downstream along the river

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,200
There are social animals

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,000
Fruit spirit can be applied to a large area

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,200
There's a new place

10
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:34,520
From now on, you no longer have to share only half a bottle of water a day.

11
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:38,810
No one is allowed to tell Su Che why there is water here.

12
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,210
Can't you tell what's more important?

13
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,610
I can still carry it without eating for fifteen days

14
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:43,410
Water is the thing that can really choke your life

15
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,610
We hold the water source in our hands

16
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:45,810
The news is a little leaked

17
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,810
Sooner or later, Su Che will have to lower his voice and beg us.

18
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,010
How much meat do you want to trade for then?

19
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,010
It's not us who has the final say

20
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,210
What if he had found it earlier?

21
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,970
He took all the chicken feathers with his hands

22
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,570
Really found so much water

23
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:57,170
I've already boiled water to scald my hair. Don't worry.

24
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:58,170
he doesn't know
